<title>DUBAI: Italian foreign minister in Saudi for talks.</title>
<headline>Italian foreign minister in Saudi for talks.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini on Monday arrived in Saudi Arabia for talks with senior officials, an Italian consulate official said.</p>
<p>The official said he arrived in Jeddah and will meet Saudi Foreign Minister Prince Saud al-Faisal and other officials in the kingdom.</p>
</text>
